+ Obtain the accessibility elements for the application owning the given process identifier.
+ Unlike -accessibilityElementsWithNestedFormat: the traversal is rooted at that application
+ instead of the frontmost application.
+ The returned value is fully JSON serializable.
+
+ @param pid the process identifier of the application to describe.
+ @param nestedFormat if YES then data is returned in the nested format, NO for flat format
+ @return the accessibility elements for the application, wrapped in a Future.
+ */
+- (FBFuture<id> *)accessibilityElementsForPid:(pid_t)pid nestedFormat:(BOOL)nestedFormat;
+
 @end
 
 
